  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CLAUSE VIOLATED: \"not a property of the call site: not the receiver's variable name\". NOTION THE SLOT CARRIES: receiver_variable (`dict`, `invalidJson`, `jsonString`) -- swift's instance of INV-kotob seen at the dst_ref level, where ONE symbol id carries DIFFERENT module_paths on different edges. That is the axiom's \"static owner path\" failing in the other direction: a key that varies per call site is a call-site property by construction."  # fc41
